[{:db/id "q-128144/selection/8caa1c26a9fe38174000789a3dac698039c8d4a0aab12b34aa4a85791d34058f" :answer/id #uuid "4147d1eb-fb8b-5506-91b9-dad20fb450dd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨2,7,0⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128144/selection/d6b574e70d267d683b7e4b12efca21e4f3b079d6f9ded5d13c3f1d8dc9cb7bde" :answer/id #uuid "031abac6-671c-565c-a358-365048416b3b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨4,7,9⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128144/selection/880a8abf7e091461b01e4f9d95754d6595e4f5ce53e6fb2a7cbb9ced30174f3a" :answer/id #uuid "4f49c43d-0768-5612-8c44-64c7dc3c3042" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-2,-5,0⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128144/selection/73712d91312830d560c32c0463e058d920232269b42f12447abe3a5ee29fa140" :answer/id #uuid "f587992d-a94c-5519-9075-62f9bc23226a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨0,-7,0⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128144/selection/f606b642b5897c54978e959d70dce2ba27f09e39efef75ce3818093ae811ab6e" :answer/id #uuid "8567c48f-8907-53fe-8c90-13d04efbfe42" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨0,-5,1⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128144/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "1f9e8c85-a5ba-5567-813c-0bafae8804f3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-128144/selection/f606b642b5897c54978e959d70dce2ba27f09e39efef75ce3818093ae811ab6e" :answer-field/choices ["q-128144/selection/8caa1c26a9fe38174000789a3dac698039c8d4a0aab12b34aa4a85791d34058f" "q-128144/selection/d6b574e70d267d683b7e4b12efca21e4f3b079d6f9ded5d13c3f1d8dc9cb7bde" "q-128144/selection/880a8abf7e091461b01e4f9d95754d6595e4f5ce53e6fb2a7cbb9ced30174f3a" "q-128144/selection/73712d91312830d560c32c0463e058d920232269b42f12447abe3a5ee29fa140" "q-128144/selection/f606b642b5897c54978e959d70dce2ba27f09e39efef75ce3818093ae811ab6e"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-128144" :question/id #uuid "998ff16d-b6a6-5973-8b01-9ee14eef7c71" :question/math-academy-id "q-128144" :question/problem "Find the value of $(f(t)-2g(t))^{′}$ at $t=1,$ if \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(t) & =⟨{t}^{2},\\,\\operatorname{ln}⁡t,\\,{e}^{t-1}⟩, \\\\ g(t) & =⟨2\\sqrt{t},\\,{t}^{3},\\,3⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, notice that\n\n$$\n(f(t)-2g(t))^{′}={f}^{′}(t)-2{g}^{′}(t).\n$$\n\nLet's now find the derivatives of each function.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(t) & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({t}^{2}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡t),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({e}^{t-1})⟩ \\\\  & =⟨2t,\\,\\frac{1}{t},\\,{e}^{t-1}⟩ \\\\ {g}^{′}(t) & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(2\\sqrt{t}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({t}^{3}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(3)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{t}},\\,3{t}^{2},\\,0⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(f(1)-2g(1))^{′} & ={f}^{′}(1)-2{g}^{′}(1) \\\\  & =⟨2(1),\\,\\frac{1}{1},\\,{e}^{1-1}⟩-2⟨\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1}},\\,3(1)^{2},\\,0⟩ \\\\  & =⟨2,1,1⟩-2⟨1,3,0⟩ \\\\  & =⟨2,1,1⟩-⟨2,6,0⟩ \\\\  & =⟨0,-5,1⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-128144/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "49b54258-61d2-549c-94e4-a251f6d2a656"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-128144"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-128137/selection/13cb6c5da950ef5f936873ab2bc4a015f5f8125ec00c5e42ae48e1e9ebc8ca6e" :answer/id #uuid "a8378d1a-2e8e-5db8-a286-9715404e7727" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨1,-1,0⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128137/selection/e1ecaf61b3bd668c819ab4edebf792ebf9a50a8550fcec63b3b6f9c5e89ef1f5" :answer/id #uuid "9bf664db-615e-51ef-815b-19d363ed3451" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨2,1,-2⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128137/selection/7de4249d24fe83bc7cb30eb9550dd63331a0c24f23022cf94e5e376cb7186fa3" :answer/id #uuid "8f7e89ae-cf28-500c-b781-0e7d57b552c5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨2,-1,-2⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128137/selection/9074666b83343e965689a4a2401a6b8dffa21fcb1b35233b95dc12ee1380be11" :answer/id #uuid "fa398655-a6f7-5963-a19f-324590d187fa" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨2,-3,-2⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128137/selection/51c7d6fb082408d04b5e876284f46d8472350735351227a656894a87802772f4" :answer/id #uuid "145387f4-89bc-5258-9320-a5ca8fd7ff14" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨0,-1,-2⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128137/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "5626a4b7-29d8-57bc-911b-f7b5e71790a6" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-128137/selection/9074666b83343e965689a4a2401a6b8dffa21fcb1b35233b95dc12ee1380be11" :answer-field/choices ["q-128137/selection/13cb6c5da950ef5f936873ab2bc4a015f5f8125ec00c5e42ae48e1e9ebc8ca6e" "q-128137/selection/e1ecaf61b3bd668c819ab4edebf792ebf9a50a8550fcec63b3b6f9c5e89ef1f5" "q-128137/selection/7de4249d24fe83bc7cb30eb9550dd63331a0c24f23022cf94e5e376cb7186fa3" "q-128137/selection/9074666b83343e965689a4a2401a6b8dffa21fcb1b35233b95dc12ee1380be11" "q-128137/selection/51c7d6fb082408d04b5e876284f46d8472350735351227a656894a87802772f4"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-128137" :question/id #uuid "d9ac2eaf-d9c7-536c-9c41-51336e100c20" :question/math-academy-id "q-128137" :question/problem "Find the value of $(f(t)-3g(t))^{′}$ at $t=0,$ if \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(t) & =⟨2\\sqrt{t+1},\\,{t}^{3},\\,\\operatorname{ln}⁡(t+1)⟩, \\\\ g(t) & =⟨\\frac{1}{3(t+1)},\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡t,\\,\\operatorname{tan}⁡t⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, notice that\n\n$$\n(f(t)-3g(t))^{′}={f}^{′}(t)-3{g}^{′}(t).\n$$\n\nLet's now find the derivatives of each function.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(t) & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(2\\sqrt{t+1}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({t}^{3}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡(t+1))⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{t+1}},\\,3{t}^{2},\\,\\frac{1}{t+1}⟩ \\\\ {g}^{′}(t) & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\frac{1}{3(t+1)}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡t),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\operatorname{tan}⁡t)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-\\frac{1}{3(t+1)^{2}},\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡t,\\,{sec}^{2}⁡t⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(f(0)-3g(0))^{′} & ={f}^{′}(0)-3{g}^{′}(0) \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{0+1}},\\,3(0)^{2},\\,\\frac{1}{0+1}⟩-3⟨-\\frac{1}{3(0+1)^{2}},\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡0,\\,{sec}^{2}⁡0⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1,0,1⟩-3⟨-\\frac{1}{3},1,1⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1,0,1⟩-⟨-1,3,3⟩ \\\\  & =⟨2,-3,-2⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-128137/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "49b54258-61d2-549c-94e4-a251f6d2a656"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-128137"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-71233/selection/16dbf4f1c179cc267de84787ae4c0c3a5213c6597d7d7eda607567a330f3c684" :answer/id #uuid "3a24600b-bec7-582c-8358-d9ad16ece6a7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}(4{t}^{2}+t){e}^{t} \\\\ ({t}^{2}-1){e}^{t} \\\\ {e}^{t}\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71233/selection/8f50f4010080c6fe2d9518baf6b17538a11e52cc985f65546a8355f91f8ebc4d" :answer/id #uuid "72d3a144-1d80-532a-85f7-47242f0ab0d5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}(-5{t}^{3}-3{t}^{2}+1){e}^{t} \\\\ (3{t}^{2}-t-1){e}^{t} \\\\ (t+2){e}^{t}\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71233/selection/cc0ffc5da8a598547b0eb01cc8724ad0d5ee785aa7e52356098fad8f076b7089" :answer/id #uuid "4766c391-2676-52d7-8aa4-a22501ffdfec" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}7{t}^{3}{e}^{t} \\\\ {t}^{2}{e}^{t} \\\\ 4t{e}^{t}\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71233/selection/91058f0d76f3d57f0e6ea254f65e8fea206af21544b30a1184d93ac4e205c9ba" :answer/id #uuid "02f8dfae-49ed-5983-8070-5cc9054270c7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}({t}^{2}-4t+4) \\\\ ({t}^{2}-1) \\\\ (2t+3)\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71233/selection/6907121f8e3a48642ba2af64c40e55425fd13eeb51a432c56c48f016f0e7bc92" :answer/id #uuid "4e17aabf-76f2-559d-9a9c-4307ac5d9538" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}(2{t}^{3}+6{t}^{2}-3){e}^{t} \\\\ ({t}^{2}+2t+1){e}^{t} \\\\ (4t-3){e}^{t}\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71233/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "49c6530a-c2dc-5a22-ac72-a70ce3ccef74" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-71233/selection/6907121f8e3a48642ba2af64c40e55425fd13eeb51a432c56c48f016f0e7bc92" :answer-field/choices ["q-71233/selection/16dbf4f1c179cc267de84787ae4c0c3a5213c6597d7d7eda607567a330f3c684" "q-71233/selection/8f50f4010080c6fe2d9518baf6b17538a11e52cc985f65546a8355f91f8ebc4d" "q-71233/selection/cc0ffc5da8a598547b0eb01cc8724ad0d5ee785aa7e52356098fad8f076b7089" "q-71233/selection/91058f0d76f3d57f0e6ea254f65e8fea206af21544b30a1184d93ac4e205c9ba" "q-71233/selection/6907121f8e3a48642ba2af64c40e55425fd13eeb51a432c56c48f016f0e7bc92"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-71233" :question/id #uuid "1c08c320-55ed-59e1-87a0-c92a722748de" :question/math-academy-id "q-71233" :question/problem "Find ${(u(t)f(t))}^{′}$ where $f(t)=[\\begin{aligned}2{t}^{3}-3 \\\\ {t}^{2}+1 \\\\ 4t-7\\end{aligned}]$ and $u(t)={e}^{t}.$" :question/worked-solution "Using the scalar function multiple rule, we can write\n\n$$\n{(u(t)f(t))}^{′}={u}^{′}(t)f(t)+u(t){f}^{′}(t)\n$$\n\nLet's find ${u}^{′}(t)$ and ${f}^{′}(t).$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(t) & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(2{t}^{3}-3) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({t}^{2}+1) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(4t-7)\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}6{t}^{2} \\\\ 2t \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}] \\\\ {u}^{′}(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({e}^{t})={e}^{t}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{(u(t)f(t))}^{′} & ={u}^{′}(t)f(t)+u(t){f}^{′}(t) \\\\  & ={e}^{t}[\\begin{aligned}2{t}^{3}-3 \\\\ {t}^{2}+1 \\\\ 4t-7\\end{aligned}]+{e}^{t}[\\begin{aligned}6{t}^{2} \\\\ 2t \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}(2{t}^{3}-3){e}^{t} \\\\ ({t}^{2}+1){e}^{t} \\\\ (4t-7){e}^{t}\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}6{t}^{2}{e}^{t} \\\\ 2t{e}^{t} \\\\ 4{e}^{t}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}(2{t}^{3}+6{t}^{2}-3){e}^{t} \\\\ ({t}^{2}+2t+1){e}^{t} \\\\ (4t-3){e}^{t}\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-71233/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "b19f5f01-948e-5f44-8016-63073ed31dbc"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-71233"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-70688/selection/dc34fbec5f453ff2c2aff13aec6f4d5a45ef4aa79f61531cb481e3226b8d6125" :answer/id #uuid "09108b3f-ab49-511b-8b83-ac72b59135c2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ {cos}^{2}⁡t-{sin}^{2}⁡t \\\\ {e}^{t}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡t-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70688/selection/9750905ed7f4de42925bbc33a3dbcdbf0ad537c7601da5c1842858ca8c533c17" :answer/id #uuid "1b323b05-c878-5516-82d1-54b0b8d252bb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ {e}^{t}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡t+\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70688/selection/9762ec5f0c81687ea45b41ea0f32293180db56ca68e8419644292288c7ae1462" :answer/id #uuid "8d5e28e6-49a2-58c4-894e-d739e73f1af0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t \\\\ 1 \\\\ {e}^{t}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡t+\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70688/selection/ba923d5590a65c36a92ffb3c0208684ceae5892cf68a09acf33ccbc62aac2e22" :answer/id #uuid "c608e3b2-4517-504e-99ea-1522e78de9f1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t \\\\ \\operatorname{cos}⁡2t \\\\ {e}^{t}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡t+\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70688/selection/c011d32156ad2fea5b1a36ae1191c68726d91005e3781e4f58562b2e7473e8f9" :answer/id #uuid "ced93244-e034-5fb2-b3f1-e294eece24f5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}⁡4t \\\\ {cos}^{2}⁡t-{sin}^{2}⁡t \\\\ {e}^{t}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡t-\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-70688/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "e6be07ee-6b79-50e9-8fdf-2aa2953e9f2e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-70688/selection/ba923d5590a65c36a92ffb3c0208684ceae5892cf68a09acf33ccbc62aac2e22" :answer-field/choices ["q-70688/selection/dc34fbec5f453ff2c2aff13aec6f4d5a45ef4aa79f61531cb481e3226b8d6125" "q-70688/selection/9750905ed7f4de42925bbc33a3dbcdbf0ad537c7601da5c1842858ca8c533c17" "q-70688/selection/9762ec5f0c81687ea45b41ea0f32293180db56ca68e8419644292288c7ae1462" "q-70688/selection/ba923d5590a65c36a92ffb3c0208684ceae5892cf68a09acf33ccbc62aac2e22" "q-70688/selection/c011d32156ad2fea5b1a36ae1191c68726d91005e3781e4f58562b2e7473e8f9"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-70688" :question/id #uuid "9d92bf36-e24a-53bf-b359-cf412f728c8a" :question/math-academy-id "q-70688" :question/problem "Find $(u(t)f(t))^{′}$ where $f(t)=[\\begin{aligned}2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t \\\\ \\operatorname{cos}⁡t \\\\ {e}^{t}\\end{aligned}]$ and $u(t)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡t.$" :question/worked-solution "Using the scalar function multiple rule, we can write\n\n$$\n(u(t)f(t))^{′}={u}^{′}(t)f(t)+u(t){f}^{′}(t).\n$$\n\nLet's find ${u}^{′}(t)$ and ${f}^{′}(t).$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(t) & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡t) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({e}^{t})\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}2\\operatorname{cos}⁡t \\\\ -\\operatorname{sin}⁡t \\\\ {e}^{t}\\end{aligned}] \\\\ {u}^{′}(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)=\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(u(t)f(t))^{′} & ={u}^{′}(t)f(t)+u(t){f}^{′}(t) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡t[\\begin{aligned}2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t \\\\ \\operatorname{cos}⁡t \\\\ {e}^{t}\\end{aligned}]+\\operatorname{sin}⁡t[\\begin{aligned}2\\operatorname{cos}⁡t \\\\ -\\operatorname{sin}⁡t \\\\ {e}^{t}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\operatorname{cos}⁡t \\\\ \\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\operatorname{cos}⁡t \\\\ {e}^{t}\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}2\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\operatorname{cos}⁡t \\\\ -\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\operatorname{sin}⁡t \\\\ {e}^{t}\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t \\\\ {cos}^{2}⁡t \\\\ {e}^{t}\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t \\\\ -{sin}^{2}⁡t \\\\ {e}^{t}\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t \\\\ {cos}^{2}⁡t-{sin}^{2}⁡t \\\\ {e}^{t}\\operatorname{cos}⁡t+{e}^{t}\\operatorname{sin}⁡t\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2\\operatorname{sin}⁡2t \\\\ \\operatorname{cos}⁡2t \\\\ {e}^{t}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡t+\\operatorname{sin}⁡t)\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-70688/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "b19f5f01-948e-5f44-8016-63073ed31dbc"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-70688"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-128479/selection/676413800f24d3afa6371c346f1de2bca41d33a3ed10b93a07095f2990709fe0" :answer/id #uuid "bcd32d6d-197b-5122-922e-796ce941b022" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨1-2t,\\,-2t,\\,2t-3{t}^{2}⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128479/selection/5238f2eb53e090699280cda864d4bfb41e7a0092f2050cb88bd0caa8a9f8d6b3" :answer/id #uuid "44fa11c5-5cdd-51c2-8d93-7774023871c7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨t,\\,-2{t}^{2},\\,2t-3{t}^{2}⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128479/selection/5b721fc5fd9ee3b4073a1b9e56fb719070f8a93a303893b54c05e3992c8c5908" :answer/id #uuid "f485f643-b3bb-5e23-90d8-3cb37826e688" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨1-2t,\\,-1,\\,2t-3{t}^{2}⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128479/selection/22a1961137feacf338ff72e898f8028038c3d74a6307c73b82d9e68a5c07658c" :answer/id #uuid "84e969af-e471-50c3-924a-5caf9e83a376" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨t-2,\\,-t,\\,t-2{t}^{2}⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128479/selection/488e398a9a8078b75fe794c0c8f410619190c4a50cf1c9e188520e0cfb76c811" :answer/id #uuid "617dab13-2ef0-5b4e-b2d7-9a43965309ef" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨1+t,\\,2+t,\\,t+3{t}^{2}⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128479/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "42f570f3-ab14-5f81-9633-edee0836a050" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-128479/selection/676413800f24d3afa6371c346f1de2bca41d33a3ed10b93a07095f2990709fe0" :answer-field/choices ["q-128479/selection/676413800f24d3afa6371c346f1de2bca41d33a3ed10b93a07095f2990709fe0" "q-128479/selection/5238f2eb53e090699280cda864d4bfb41e7a0092f2050cb88bd0caa8a9f8d6b3" "q-128479/selection/5b721fc5fd9ee3b4073a1b9e56fb719070f8a93a303893b54c05e3992c8c5908" "q-128479/selection/22a1961137feacf338ff72e898f8028038c3d74a6307c73b82d9e68a5c07658c" "q-128479/selection/488e398a9a8078b75fe794c0c8f410619190c4a50cf1c9e188520e0cfb76c811"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-128479" :question/id #uuid "18a00e84-221d-594d-b6f9-e53f669e5261" :question/math-academy-id "q-128479" :question/problem "Find  $(u(t)g(t))^{′}$ where $g(t)=⟨t,\\,1+t,\\,{t}^{2}⟩$ and $u(t)=1-t.$" :question/worked-solution "By the scalar function multiple rule, we have\n\n$$\n(u(t)g(t))^{′}=u(t){g}^{′}(t)+{u}^{′}(t)g(t).\n$$\n\nLet's find ${u}^{′}(t)$ and ${g}^{′}(t).$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{g}^{′}(t) & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(1+t),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({t}^{2})⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1,\\,1,\\,2t⟩ \\\\ {u}^{′}(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(1-t) \\\\  & =-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(u(t)g(t))^{′} & =u(t){g}^{′}(t)+{u}^{′}(t)g(t) \\\\  & =(1-t)⟨1,\\,1,\\,2t⟩-⟨t,\\,1+t,\\,{t}^{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1-t,\\,1-t,\\,2t-2{t}^{2}⟩-⟨t,\\,1+t,\\,{t}^{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1-2t,\\,-2t,\\,2t-3{t}^{2}⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-128479/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "b19f5f01-948e-5f44-8016-63073ed31dbc"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-128479"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-128561/selection/4ed758a8540ba61910a5540c2a2747a435afc8b2b7a92917ce75b2a387420eed" :answer/id #uuid "46732a83-1f2b-5506-8b3e-15d59d1191c5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\,i-2{e}^{-t}\\,j-\\frac{1}{4}{e}^{-t/2}\\,k" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128561/selection/7cee805df2c6b939dc845551588db80bf0e939ab8b1878e7b6458e4f99abf988" :answer/id #uuid "3eaf1cfe-d17c-5dc5-b155-da79708caf87" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\,i-2{e}^{-2t}\\,j-\\frac{1}{2}{e}^{-t/2}\\,k" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128561/selection/178ffc8f5c37bfc27a0ca1a60bb284169b8d4ed2f8c11f794b51090c02aa4d9d" :answer/id #uuid "5291d00d-743d-5eb3-8a36-7fb0146bf13a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\,i-{e}^{-2t}\\,j-2{e}^{-t/2}\\,k" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128561/selection/081b86c36de51bc03263fb8b351f9ced1524978126165f2010397c036b4fff6b" :answer/id #uuid "4e96f786-686e-5266-ad77-05a5866ea33c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\,i-4{e}^{-2t}\\,j-2{e}^{-3t/2}\\,k" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128561/selection/89af5ca8396b8a22d7f9823bb74d9819eb73c32cdaa1bceedeb4b8ff76759906" :answer/id #uuid "7d214e3e-0e0e-5da3-9fcb-8e67aeb62deb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\,i-2{e}^{2t}\\,j-\\frac{1}{2}{e}^{t}\\,k" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128561/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "79fd7cee-b9e6-5e1a-bd8d-f827f3bc4139" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-128561/selection/7cee805df2c6b939dc845551588db80bf0e939ab8b1878e7b6458e4f99abf988" :answer-field/choices ["q-128561/selection/4ed758a8540ba61910a5540c2a2747a435afc8b2b7a92917ce75b2a387420eed" "q-128561/selection/7cee805df2c6b939dc845551588db80bf0e939ab8b1878e7b6458e4f99abf988" "q-128561/selection/178ffc8f5c37bfc27a0ca1a60bb284169b8d4ed2f8c11f794b51090c02aa4d9d" "q-128561/selection/081b86c36de51bc03263fb8b351f9ced1524978126165f2010397c036b4fff6b" "q-128561/selection/89af5ca8396b8a22d7f9823bb74d9819eb73c32cdaa1bceedeb4b8ff76759906"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-128561" :question/id #uuid "629c6742-cb38-552f-bd6e-09f3aee65a84" :question/math-academy-id "q-128561" :question/problem "If $f(u)=\\operatorname{ln}⁡u\\,i+{u}^{2}\\,j+\\sqrt{u}\\,k$ and $u(t)={e}^{-t},$ then $(f∘u)^{′}(t)=$" :question/worked-solution "Using the chain rule, we can write\n\n$$\n(f∘u)^{′}(t)={f}^{′}(u(t)){u}^{′}(t).\n$$\n\nLet's now find the derivatives of each function.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(u) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}u}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡u)i+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}u}({u}^{2})j+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}u}(\\sqrt{u})k \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{u}\\,i+2u\\,j+\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{u}}\\,k \\\\ {u}^{′}(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}({e}^{-t})=-{e}^{-t}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(f∘u)^{′}(t) & ={f}^{′}(u(t))\\cdot {u}^{′}(t) \\\\  & =(\\frac{1}{u(t)}\\,i+2u(t)\\,j+\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{u(t)}}\\,k)\\cdot {u}^{′}(t) \\\\  & =(\\frac{1}{{e}^{-t}}\\,i+2{e}^{-t}\\,j+\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{{e}^{-t}}}\\,k)\\cdot (-{e}^{-t}) \\\\  & =({e}^{t}\\,i+2{e}^{-t}\\,j+\\frac{1}{2}{e}^{t/2}\\,k)\\cdot (-{e}^{-t}) \\\\  & =-\\,i-2{e}^{-2t}\\,j-\\frac{1}{2}{e}^{-t/2}\\,k.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-128561/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "a146d5d3-2562-5b8b-886e-4cf6519d3282"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-128561"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-32347/selection/aab06f78e69218e44ee2c0e0e2ab08f589cc32996fe08d087e0ca1728a9c7cc9" :answer/id #uuid "7f692b5b-9fe1-530c-9fed-b49bf486955e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-28t,\\,-24{t}^{2},\\,36{t}^{3}⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-32347/selection/ce84a380387435b5b7712f3f419e1390cf657490d5497e69430b093542b88bc4" :answer/id #uuid "acc8014c-5d38-5f78-bb1f-5b2448074b0b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-20t-2,\\,-72{t}^{2}+12t,\\,72{t}^{3}-6⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-32347/selection/617f563cf799aee3e69395433c4c415ee9b54aa5ecc22760b1cdee962529a249" :answer/id #uuid "85b526a8-8db3-5bf6-b5cd-cfee816aa367" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨20t-2,\\,36{t}^{2}+12t,\\,72{t}^{3}⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-32347/selection/aa16689c20ee6ff654f363711fd32abdd49dd63a0973be929f70884efe5bfca7" :answer/id #uuid "3c944907-531e-5729-baea-c63a7a7e55c3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨48t-2,\\,-362{t}^{2}+12t,\\,6⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-32347/selection/7d0a9405b437e76404d0cd92787087ec6a2c7936f004fcdbffa9c090fe88488e" :answer/id #uuid "ec1b7c40-03b4-5b50-b43e-d0aad1c3e842" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨8t-2,\\,-48{t}^{2}+12t,\\,36{t}^{3}-6⟩" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-32347/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "ff9bbd85-c245-5155-b9f5-cacaea15915a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-32347/selection/ce84a380387435b5b7712f3f419e1390cf657490d5497e69430b093542b88bc4" :answer-field/choices ["q-32347/selection/aab06f78e69218e44ee2c0e0e2ab08f589cc32996fe08d087e0ca1728a9c7cc9" "q-32347/selection/ce84a380387435b5b7712f3f419e1390cf657490d5497e69430b093542b88bc4" "q-32347/selection/617f563cf799aee3e69395433c4c415ee9b54aa5ecc22760b1cdee962529a249" "q-32347/selection/aa16689c20ee6ff654f363711fd32abdd49dd63a0973be929f70884efe5bfca7" "q-32347/selection/7d0a9405b437e76404d0cd92787087ec6a2c7936f004fcdbffa9c090fe88488e"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-32347" :question/id #uuid "5c0ab63c-e0ff-5937-9e2f-94c308127204" :question/math-academy-id "q-32347" :question/problem "Find $(f\\times g)^{′}(t)$ given that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(t) & =⟨6{t}^{2},\\,2t,\\,6⟩ \\\\ g(t) & =⟨3,\\,3{t}^{2},\\,4t-1⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Using the cross product rule, we can write:\n\n$$\n(f\\times g)^{′}(t)={f}^{′}(t)\\times g(t)+f(t)\\times {g}^{′}(t)\n$$\n\nLet's now find the derivatives of each function.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(t) & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(6{t}^{2}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(2t),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(6)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨12t,\\,2,\\,0⟩ \\\\ {g}^{′}(t) & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(3),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(3{t}^{2}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(4t-1)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨0,\\,6t,\\,4⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(t)\\times g(t) & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 12t & 2 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 3{t}^{2} & (4t-1)\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 \\\\ 3{t}^{2} & (4t-1)\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}12t & 0 \\\\ 3 & (4t-1)\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}12t & 2 \\\\ 3 & 3{t}^{2}\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =⟨8t-2,\\,12t-48{t}^{2},\\,36{t}^{3}-6⟩ \\\\ f(t)\\times {g}^{′}(t) & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 6{t}^{2} & 2t & 6 \\\\ 0 & 6t & 4\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}2t & 6 \\\\ 6t & 4\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}6{t}^{2} & 6 \\\\ 0 & 4\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}6{t}^{2} & 2t \\\\ 0 & 6t\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =⟨-28t,\\,-24{t}^{2},\\,36{t}^{3}⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(f\\times g)^{′}(t) & =⟨8t-2,\\,12t-48{t}^{2},\\,36{t}^{3}-6⟩+⟨-28t,\\,-24{t}^{2},\\,36{t}^{3}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-20t-2,\\,-72{t}^{2}+12t,\\,72{t}^{3}-6⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-32347/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d54a6dbe-42cb-5614-ae0b-611de1719b45"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-32347"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-33336/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "d93461f7-41c2-5f4c-b4bd-7d4889c7cf66" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-33336/selection/01884be2303b49be7d25f50f551b91d3322d57e47e22c797ee8f984d1491a644" :answer/id #uuid "e8d48287-ff7a-5e8d-a934-26c91d505422" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\operatorname{ln}⁡t+2-\\frac{2}{{t}^{3}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-33336/selection/22fc5d4cca572454a6611606b43ed41a26ac14c579e46194ff84fcb024f6b644" :answer/id #uuid "ca975716-fbdc-55d1-a21d-f1fb9eb11513" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{ln}⁡t+1-\\frac{1}{{t}^{3}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-33336/selection/dd09d2de5215c21bd889bbae65adc9a19dc43e729f636244d95a6c6a0c704fa5" :answer/id #uuid "8039cc8f-7a06-56e9-8ddf-13e4e99f3d9f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{ln}⁡t+1+\\frac{1}{{t}^{3}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-33336/selection/32780e9437da69d93c9d5a3c0dc1171a58fe5e7b3b3f344d7b539d55c93104ba" :answer/id #uuid "3d739f7f-39e9-5319-a6c6-bc4f8a984dd5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\operatorname{ln}⁡t+\\frac{2}{{t}^{3}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-33336/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "00fb4126-f3f6-57ea-8ef9-4bcd2322c849" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-33336/selection/01884be2303b49be7d25f50f551b91d3322d57e47e22c797ee8f984d1491a644" :answer-field/choices ["q-33336/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" "q-33336/selection/01884be2303b49be7d25f50f551b91d3322d57e47e22c797ee8f984d1491a644" "q-33336/selection/22fc5d4cca572454a6611606b43ed41a26ac14c579e46194ff84fcb024f6b644" "q-33336/selection/dd09d2de5215c21bd889bbae65adc9a19dc43e729f636244d95a6c6a0c704fa5" "q-33336/selection/32780e9437da69d93c9d5a3c0dc1171a58fe5e7b3b3f344d7b539d55c93104ba"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-33336" :question/id #uuid "be74f492-9033-596e-9832-26e64c8a9083" :question/math-academy-id "q-33336" :question/problem "Find $(f\\cdot g)^{′}(t)$, given that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(t) & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡t\\,i+\\frac{1}{t}\\,j+t\\,k \\\\ g(t) & =t\\,i+\\frac{1}{t}\\,j+\\operatorname{ln}⁡t\\,k\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Using the dot product rule, we can write:\n\n$$\n(f\\cdot g)^{′}(t)={f}^{′}(t)\\cdot g(t)+f(t)\\cdot {g}^{′}(t)\n$$\n\nLet's now find the derivatives of each function.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡t)\\,i+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\frac{1}{t})\\,j+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t)\\,k \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{t}\\,i+(-\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}})\\,j+1\\,k \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{t}\\,i-\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}}\\,j+k \\\\ {g}^{′}(t) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t)\\,i+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\frac{1}{t})\\,j+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡t)\\,k \\\\  & =1\\,i+(-\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}})\\,j+\\frac{1}{t}\\,k \\\\  & =i-\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}}\\,j+\\frac{1}{t}\\,k\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(f\\cdot g)^{′}(t) & ={f}^{′}(t)\\cdot g(t)+f(t)\\cdot {g}^{′}(t) \\\\  & =(\\frac{1}{t}\\,i-\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}}\\,j+k)\\cdot (t\\,i+\\frac{1}{t}\\,j+\\operatorname{ln}⁡t\\,k)+(\\operatorname{ln}⁡t\\,i+\\frac{1}{t}\\,j+t\\,k)\\cdot (i-\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}}\\,j+\\frac{1}{t}\\,k) \\\\  & =(\\frac{1}{t}\\cdot t-\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}}\\cdot \\frac{1}{t}+1\\cdot \\operatorname{ln}⁡t)+(\\operatorname{ln}⁡t\\cdot 1+\\frac{1}{t}(-\\frac{1}{{t}^{2}})+t\\cdot \\frac{1}{t}) \\\\  & =1-\\frac{1}{{t}^{3}}+\\operatorname{ln}⁡t+\\operatorname{ln}⁡t-\\frac{1}{{t}^{3}}+1 \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{ln}⁡t+2-\\frac{2}{{t}^{3}}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-33336/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d54a6dbe-42cb-5614-ae0b-611de1719b45"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-33336"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-32353"] :question/problem "Find $(f\\times g)^{′}(t)$ where\n\n$$\nf(t)=[\\begin{aligned}3{t}^{2} \\\\ t+4 \\\\ 8\\end{aligned}],\\,g(t)=[\\begin{aligned}t+2 \\\\ -2{t}^{2} \\\\ 5t\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Using the cross product rule, we can write:\n\n$$\n(f\\times g)^{′}(t)={f}^{′}(t)\\times g(t)+f(t)\\times {g}^{′}(t)\n$$\n\nLet's now find the derivatives of each function.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(t) & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(3{t}^{2}) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t+4) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(8)\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}6t \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\ {g}^{′}(t) & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(t+2) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(-2{t}^{2}) \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(5t)\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -4t \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(t)\\times g(t) & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 6t & 1 & 0 \\\\ t+2 & -2{t}^{2} & 5t\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ -2{t}^{2} & 5t\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}6t & 0 \\\\ t+2 & 5t\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}6t & 1 \\\\ t+2 & -2{t}^{2}\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}5t \\\\ -30{t}^{2} \\\\ -12{t}^{3}-t-2\\end{aligned}] \\\\ f(t)\\times {g}^{′}(t) & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 3{t}^{2} & t+4 & 8 \\\\ 1 & -4t & 5\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}t+4 & 8 \\\\ -4t & 5\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}3{t}^{2} & 8 \\\\ 1 & 5\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}3{t}^{2} & t+4 \\\\ 1 & -4t\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}37t+20 \\\\ 8-15{t}^{2} \\\\ -12{t}^{3}-t-4\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(f\\times g)^{′}(t) & =[\\begin{aligned}5t \\\\ -30{t}^{2} \\\\ -12{t}^{3}-t-2\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}37t+20 \\\\ 8-15{t}^{2} \\\\ -12{t}^{3}-t-4\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}42t+20 \\\\ 8-45{t}^{2} \\\\ -24{t}^{3}-2t-6\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "e-2478"] :question/problem "Find $\\big( u(t) \\mathbf g(t) \\big)'$ where ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14077032/assets/9e23d542bfc56d506f5437a35a92c304d618109ef60086e1f5a7a4fee57d8a80.png) and $u(t) = t.$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]}]
